From: Detlev Casanova <detlev.casanova@collabora.com>
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] Backport HEVC EXT SPS RPS controls to pinned FFmpeg 7.1

Based on Collabora commit a8eb4b006d055f0be43d4a03d87472d2f199f177.
Retains the 7.1 start_frame ABI and adds a guarded Linux UAPI compatibility
header for this private build. No system headers or installed libs modified.

